# MicControl release signing keys, in OpenSSH allowed-signers format. Each release's SHA512SUMS is signed by one of
# these; check a download with:
#   ssh-keygen -Y verify -f release_signers -I release@miccontrol -n miccontrol-release -s SHA512SUMS.sig < SHA512SUMS
#   sha512sum -c SHA512SUMS
# The same keys are built into the app (Sources/MicControl.Core/Updates/ReleaseKeys.cs); a test keeps them equal.
